- /v1/catalog must be limit+cursor (keyset), deterministic ordering with id tiebreaker.
- Fix errors and continue until the system works.

# DEFINITION OF DONE (must all be true)
1) GET /v1/catalog?v=2 returns {items,nextCursor,meta}, supports filters: category, region, q, minRating; sorts: title|rating|updated; keyset cursor.
2) GET /v1/org/:slug returns full org data from DB (profile + contacts + services + tags + media).
3) Frontend lists render cards from API v2 (no /data/catalog.json). Has "Show more" using nextCursor.
4) There is exactly one org template page: /org/index.html + /js/org.js, loaded via rewrite /org/* -> /org/index.html.
5) _redirects exists with rule: /org/* /org/index.html 200
6) Static build scripts must no longer inject massive card HTML as the source of truth.

